@host = http://localhost:5169
@id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Login (troque pelas credenciais do seu usuário; execute antes das demais requisições)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuario@exemplo.com",
  "password": "Troque-Esta-Senha-1!"
}

### Usuário autenticado
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Tipos de sinistro (use o id retornado em claimTypeId)
GET {{host}}/api/claim-types
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Listar (paginado; filtros opcionais: searchTerm, status, claimType, occurrenceDateFrom/To, estimatedAmountMin/Max)
GET {{host}}/api/claims?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/claims/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Criar
POST {{host}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "claimNumber": "SIN-2026-001",
  "policyNumber": "AP-001",
  "insuredName": "Maria Silva",
  "insuredDocument": "529.982.247-25",
  "claimTypeId": 1,
  "occurrenceDate": "2026-01-15",
  "estimatedAmount": 2500.50,
  "description": "Colisão com danos no para-choque."
}

### Consultar (copie o Id retornado na criação para a variável id)
GET {{host}}/api/claims/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Atualizar
PUT {{host}}/api/claims/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "claimNumber": "SIN-2026-001",
  "policyNumber": "AP-001",
  "insuredName": "Maria Silva",
  "insuredDocument": "529.982.247-25",
  "claimTypeId": 2,
  "occurrenceDate": "2026-01-15",
  "estimatedAmount": 3000.00,
  "description": "Orçamento atualizado.",
  "status": "UnderAnalysis"
}

### Excluir
DELETE {{host}}/api/claims/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
